# Backend Python

- Layers: `controller` → `service` → `repository`; API DTOs in `lexloop/model/`.
- Domain sessions are sync (`get_db`). Auth uses async SQLAlchemy — keep them separate unless intentionally unifying.
- Schema changes: Alembic (`./backend/do db-migration-new`). Tests use `create_all` + `db_seed.sql`.
- Ruff for format/lint; mypy via `./backend/do types`. Quality gates include both.
- Mangum handler is `lexloop.main.aws_handler`; do not break Lambda packaging (`./backend/do build`).
